@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Source Han Sans CN
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F7F9FC
  BorderColor #526070
  FontColor #111827
}

title 清单、文件与正式档案主状态机

[*] --> Draft : 编制清单
Draft --> PendingTransfer : 提交清单
PendingTransfer --> Received : 全部验收通过
PendingTransfer --> PartiallyReceived : 部分接收/部分回退
PendingTransfer --> Rejected : 整批拒绝或回退
Rejected --> [*]

PartiallyReceived --> PendingArchive : 已接收条目继续入库
Received --> PendingArchive : AI 补全/人工核对
PendingArchive --> ArchivedUnshelved : 纸质相关档案确认入库
PendingArchive --> Normal : 纯电子档案确认入库
ArchivedUnshelved --> Normal : 确认上架

Normal --> Borrowed : 借阅出库
Borrowed --> Normal : 归还确认
Normal --> Inventorying : 盘点命中范围
Inventorying --> Normal : 盘点完成
Normal --> PendingDestroy : 鉴定为待销毁
PendingDestroy --> Destroyed : 审批通过并确认销毁
Destroyed --> [*]

note right of PendingArchive
  AI 只补全白名单字段：
  题名、责任者、形成日期、
  分类、标签
end note

note right of ArchivedUnshelved
  已生成正式档号和架位记录，
  但不向查阅者和公众开放检索。
end note

@enduml
